  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Dear forum helpers, i have a big issue!\n\nI've been having this problem for around a year now, i join a world, talk with people but after 18~ minutes all audio except world and avatar audio cuts out, i've documented this for a while now and i've noticed when it is about to happen, people's voices will start stuttering, it goes from 0 to 100% and then the problem occurs.\n\nI've seen people with the same issue , but none have a decent answer to the problem, that's why i'm posting this.\n\nHopefully ya'll can help me!!\n\nKind regards,\n\nGhostlyVR",
